/*
 * The Python Imaging Library
 * $Id$
 *
 * fill image with constant pixel value
 *
 * history:
 * 95-11-26 fl moved from Imaging.c
 * 96-05-17 fl added radial fill, renamed wedge to linear
 * 98-06-23 fl changed ImageFill signature
